WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.962
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:04.142
Dashboards tell you what's happened.

3
00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:07.318
Signals and Intelligence tell you what to do next.

4
00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:12.694
Signals is a feed of things that have actually happened, and are worth acting on.

5
00:00:13.652 --> 00:00:15.677
A contact clicked a link in a campaign.

6
00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:18.435
Someone replied after months of silence.

7
00:00:19.414 --> 00:00:21.865
A competitor's contract is coming up for renewal.

8
00:00:22.515 --> 00:00:24.973
A deal has stalled, or passed its close date.

9
00:00:25.956 --> 00:00:27.855
The Analyst flagged a risk on a deal.

10
00:00:28.743 --> 00:00:32.707
Each signal is marked act now, worth a look, or for awareness.

11
00:00:33.939 --> 00:00:38.747
From any signal, Dana can open the record, create a follow-up task for the rep,

12
00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:39.721
or mark it done.

13
00:00:40.495 --> 00:00:41.954
Nothing in the feed is guessed.

14
00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.733
Each one points to the record it came from.

15
00:00:45.874 --> 00:00:47.731
Intelligence looks at the bigger picture.

16
00:00:48.712 --> 00:00:52.851
Every week, Centaur counts what's come up in the team's conversations and deals,

17
00:00:52.851 --> 00:00:55.800
and compares the last month with the three months before.

18
00:00:56.648 --> 00:00:58.134
Which competitors are turning up.

19
00:00:58.794 --> 00:01:00.478
Which objections keep coming back.

20
00:01:01.387 --> 00:01:02.867
Why deals are being lost.

21
00:01:03.353 --> 00:01:06.874
Where deals get stuck, and what the deals you win have in common.

22
00:01:07.874 --> 00:01:12.215
Each finding shows how sure it is, whether it's new, growing or fading,

23
00:01:12.215 --> 00:01:15.945
and the evidence behind it, so Dana can check it for herself.

24
00:01:16.857 --> 00:01:20.230
If HubSpot has come up in five new deals this month, she'll know,

25
00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:23.292
and she can make sure the team's battle card is up to date.

26
00:01:24.612 --> 00:01:26.865
Every number is counted from your own records.

27
00:01:27.628 --> 00:01:31.530
The AI explains a finding, but it can't add one, or change a number.

28
00:01:33.268 --> 00:01:34.521
Centaur CRM.

29
00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:37.566
Know what's changing, before it shows up in the numbers.

30
00:01:38.779 --> 00:01:42.840
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

